\f1\b0\fs28  Abbreviations (Corp vs. Corporation, Pvt vs. Private, Ltd vs. Limited), legal suffix inconsistencies, DBA/trade names, punctuation differences (& vs. "and"), word-order transpositions, typos\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b\fs30 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Address variations:
\f1\b0\fs28  Abbreviations (Rd vs. Road, St vs. Street), transliteration variants, missing components (no PIN code, no state), landmark-based references (Near SBI ATM), municipal numbering formats, component reordering\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa300\partightenfactor0

